// importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js  (spoken teleprompter version)
// Fills the host-only `script` (teleprompter) field on each agenda segment of the
// scheduled Ethics Table Talk cohort sessions.
//
// Content is SPOKEN copy composed from GA-Ethics-COMPLETE-Facilitator-Guide.md:
// openers/transitions written from the guide's intent; statute text, rule
// citations, and case facts kept verbatim; facilitator actions marked
// [DO]/[POLL]/[SLIDE]/[BREAKOUT]/[DISCUSS]/[NOTE] so nothing bracketed is read aloud.
// Keyed by segment ORDER within each half; a segment is written ONLY when its
// stored title also matches (normalized), so drift can never mis-assign a script.
//
// Targets ONLY: sessionType 'live-course', status 'scheduled', slug matching
//   ethics-table-talk-part1-wk*  -> PART1 ;  ethics-table-talk-part2-wk* -> PART2
//
// SAFE BY DEFAULT: dry run prints stored-vs-expected + char count per segment.
// Nothing writes unless you pass --apply.
//   node server/src/scripts/importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js
//   node server/src/scripts/importEthicsFacilitatorScripts.js --apply
// Requires: MONGODB_URI

